esolve any bugs we encounter. So we’re also continuously updating the demo to make sure it’s bug-free, and have since Next Fest started, updated the demo twice already. We have a google form if you want to leave feedback or report bugs/problems","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114045094","verified_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4864480-1846651706681426","game_id":"steam-4864480","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Love June: Pine & Pleasures","summary":"We’re so excited to finally announce our upcoming title Love June: Pine & Pleasures! Play as June who just moved to a cabin up north where you will help her explore her desires, Nordic Folklore and the wilderness. Date different beings: everything from Gnomes, Trolls, Nixies, Werewolves to Fairies and more.This coming week we’ll be participating in Steam Next Fest! We already have our demo available now if you want to have a sneak peek before the event starts.If you like the demo, don’t forget t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:12:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681426","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4864480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:39Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4864480":"2026-10-26T14:52:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4864480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:39Z"},"4864500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:4